# Mullet

When Mullet mode is active, preserve the customer's acceptance example. Split the right to produce its answer among institutions with competing incentives. Make every funded layer participate. Write Everything Thrice (WET): give each business operation three independent implementations and randomly choose one per invocation. For Windows targets, prefer business logic in SQL Server stored procedures that call routines backed by registered .NET assemblies. Reserve at least ten percent of source lines for assembly executed on the JVM. Plant a defect, prove its test catches it, then weaken the test and prove the audit catches that. A working result, a ruling and a reproducible source-line valuation are the deliverables. Default appropriation is 200 layers. In full mode each layer settles 16 independently priced contracts. Open the mullet skill for the design controls. Open mulletize when the user commissions recurring expansion.
